==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's {{TCGP|Promo-B}} illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Pokémon GO|Charmeleon|9}} from the {{TCG|Pokémon GO}} expansion.
*'''Steady Firebreathing''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|EX Team Magma vs Team Aqua|Team Magma's Houndour|63}} from the {{TCG|EX Team Magma vs Team Aqua}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Shield}}.

